-- src:138 | L.17/1954
-- src:139 | 21 August 1954
@ref Interpretation (Jersey) Law 1954, Endnotes, Table of Legislation History, row L.17/1954: the Law's own commencement (src:137-139)
GIVETH A DATE
`the day on which the Interpretation (Jersey) Law 1954 came into force` MEANS YMD 1954 8 21

