@ref Interpretation (Jersey) Law 1954 as consolidated for 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021: Table of Endnote References [1] to [13] (src:l_17_1954_20210927:241-270)
GIVETH A `Row of the vintage table`
`row of the inferred text` MEANS `Row of the vintage table` WITH
    `which text` IS `the inferred text from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018`
    `first day` IS YMD 2003 3 28
    `last day` IS JUST (YMD 2018 12 31)
    `source stem` IS "l_17_1954_20210927"
    `amendment that began it` IS "the Interpretation (Amendment) (Jersey) Law 2003 (L.16/2003), in force 28 March 2003: it amended Article 1(5), inserted Article 1(6) and Article 1(7), substituted Article 4, inserted Articles 5, 6(3), 9, 11(4), 13 and 14 and inserted the Schedule (endnotes [1] to [12] of the 2019 consolidation); inferred from those endnotes, not verified against L.16/2003; of these the row answers only Articles 1(5) and 1(6) and the Schedule definitions of month and midnight"

-- V1 starts on the first day of the first consolidated version; no amendment is named for the start (the page banner is the evidence).
